1
00:00:00,493 --> 00:00:02,563
(Raj:)I appreciate the apology,

2
00:00:02,561 --> 00:00:04,361
(Raj:)but it's really not necessary.

3
00:00:04,363 --> 00:00:05,893
(Raj:)I overstepped my bounds.

4
00:00:05,898 --> 00:00:07,328
(Howard:)No, Raj, you've been great.

5
00:00:07,333 --> 00:00:09,603
(Howard:)I just, I need to start
doing my part around here.

6
00:00:09,602 --> 00:00:11,072
BERNADETTE:
I hear that.

7
00:00:13,272 --> 00:00:14,802
(Raj:)Well, if that's the case,

8
00:00:14,807 --> 00:00:16,507
(Raj:)is there anything
I can do to help?

9
00:00:16,509 --> 00:00:18,139
(Howard:)Well, not right now.

10
00:00:18,144 --> 00:00:19,874
(Howard:)But we could try out
that microphone you got us,

11
00:00:19,879 --> 00:00:21,549
(Howard:)and listen to
the baby's heartbeat.

12
00:00:21,547 --> 00:00:22,817
(Howard:)Really?

13
00:00:22,815 --> 00:00:24,645
It's okay if I listen with you?!

14
00:00:24,650 --> 00:00:25,920
(Bernadette:)Of course.

15
00:00:25,918 --> 00:00:29,918
(Raj:)Can I squirt the ultrasound
jelly on your stomach?

16
00:00:31,023 --> 00:00:32,123
(Howard:)Hey, look at that.

17
00:00:32,124 --> 00:00:34,694
(Howard:)It's weird again.

18
00:00:35,861 --> 00:00:38,391
(door opens)

19
00:00:38,397 --> 00:00:39,997
(Leonard:)Okay, you have

20
00:00:39,999 --> 00:00:41,099
(Leonard:)every right to be mad.

21
00:00:41,100 --> 00:00:42,200
(Leonard:)And what you said is true.

22
00:00:42,201 --> 00:00:43,301
(Leonard:)You do make more money than me.

23
00:00:43,302 --> 00:00:44,732
(Leonard:)So I had no right
to do what I did.

24
00:00:44,737 --> 00:00:46,537
(Leonard:)And I'm so sorry.

25
00:00:46,539 --> 00:00:48,139
(Leonard:)I hope you can forgive me.

26
00:00:48,140 --> 00:00:50,340
(Penny:)How long have you had
this secret account?

27
00:00:50,342 --> 00:00:52,772
(Leonard:)A couple years,
but I just put a few bucks aside

28
00:00:52,778 --> 00:00:54,978
(Leonard:)every month for emergencies.

29
00:00:54,980 --> 00:00:56,450
(Penny:)Well, how much you got in there?

30
00:00:56,449 --> 00:00:58,849
$6,427.

31
00:00:58,851 --> 00:01:02,921
$47 once my nana's
birthday check gets here.

